				<r3d:description language="eng">The Research Data Centre of the Leibniz Institute of Ecological Urban and Regional Development (IOER) provides high-resolution data, methods, indicators, models, tools and scenarios for cross-disciplinary, spatial sustainability research. The IOER FDZ focuses, among others, on the topics of settlement and open space development, ecosystems of Germany and the built environment. The data and information offered are addressed to scientists, public administrators as well as the general public.</r3d:description>
